set
Usage: set [-eux] [--] [ARG]...

Shell builtin. Change shell options, or set the positional parameters.
With no arguments, print every shell variable.

	-e	exit as soon as any command fails
	-u	error on an undefined variable instead of using empty
	-x	print each command before running it -- the debugging flag
	-o	with no argument, list the current option settings

	set -eu		the sane default at the top of a script
	set -x		start tracing
	set +x		stop tracing

See also: unset, export
